thy family. Her father, Mr. Maxim, is a very influential businessman who has a very good relationship with the current government. Sharumi has a very stubborn, shrew, immature and childish kind of personality but unusually for people of her social status she also appears to be very kind towards her servants Haresu and Riru. Her strong sense of justice might just prove out to be fatal for her once Lieutenant Prosper's military unit stations themselves at her villa."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29768"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36c7c3d08aba0f9c4067233dfd55368c6b45e7e3f6c56567bc2489f5d820684f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e106d451c0988823d50433188da860c8e7adf1d571dbee4a16c71acfa2418ee4.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"紬 叶慧","creatorId":"vndb:s2920","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2920","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2920","name":"紬 叶慧","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8594","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29769","characterName":"ハレス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29769"},"originalCharacterName":"ハレス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haresu works as a servant at Mr. Maxim's mansion together with Riru. He is a rather timid guy who has fears of authority figures but despite his flaws he will try his best to save people he holds dear to himself. Little does he know that his life is about to change in a very dramatic way after Lieutenant Prosper's military unit stations themselves at Mr. Maxim's villa."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29769"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21655e6acf6ed77990bed0230199cc940b6ecf74f85f66780cd3747083293ca3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74ebb50ec30e4f9d68ea03be776a9d5c74d4176a1b321ba211024a22b9585e5b.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29770","characterName":"プロスパー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29770"},"originalCharacterName":"プロスパー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lieutenant Prosper, perhaps the military's most ruthless and cunning Lieutenant, was sent together with his men to a small village to investigate the rape and murder incident and to subsequently hunt down the suspected culprits, the anti-government guerrillas. What the naive villagers don't know yet is that the incident was actually all planned out by him so that he could have a gang rape party for himself. All women who were suspected of being guerrillas were arrested. That was the beginning of the insane gang rape party with Lieutenant Prosper at the helm of it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29770"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc7f5dde51ed409e29cd25dccf3698d4edf158307685a101abc52e13fbff03da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c209396ea124893bc4e8753ec9e2768f910a8d8a05b647f36bc7fc15911c574.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29771","characterName":"フェリス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29771"},"originalCharacterName":"フェリス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Feris is one of the female rebels of the guerrilla force. She is a rough and simple-minded person but generous in heart. Her body is well-toned from working out and she is a very brave woman who is not afraid to say what's on her mind."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29771"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b60a640bb1218a7ef3a40e9944fe0f6e0cbc1e0768da85361bf84461488c438e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e93b9502b36b24b942d93aadb8a6b72353af014affcbd45309c4c5dda0c5f37.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"比未子","creatorId":"vndb:s1499","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1499","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1499","name":"比未子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8593","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30063","characterName":"リル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30063"},"originalCharacterName":"リル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Riru is a maid at Mr. Maxim's mansion that works alongside Haresu. She is a gentle, reliable, kind, caring and modest person that values her virginity. Little does she know that her life is about to turn upside down once the Lieutenant Prosper's military unit comes to station themselves at her residence."},{"spoi